{"id":"d5f69ca74e2bbfd2","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-measure5-premeasure.md","title":"ZFC Measure5 Premeasure","display":"df-zfc-measure5-premeasure — ZFC Measure5 Premeasure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure5-premeasure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure5-premeasure","58-df-zfc-measure6-premeasure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure5-premeasure — ZFC Measure5 Premeasure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure5-premeasure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-premeasure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-premeasure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure5-premeasure — ZFC Measure5 Premeasure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c1f1801e6d90889c\" href=\"?note=c1f1801e6d90889c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal R,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R_{\\geq 0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb R_{\\geq 0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\in V\\)</span> (extended nonnegative range)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5Premeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5Premeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Premeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Premeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (merged predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c1f1801e6d90889c\" href=\"?note=c1f1801e6d90889c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-ring-of-sets.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeSeries}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (series-value relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extended\\text{-}nonnegative\\text{-}series}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeSeries}_S(a,s)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land s=\\sup\\left\\{\\sum_{n&lt;m}a(n):m\\in\\omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extended\\text{-}nonnegative\\text{-}series}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeSeries}_S(a,s)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land s=\\sup\\left\\{\\sum_{n&lt;m}a(n):m\\in\\omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}premeasure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5Premeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal R,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land\\mu(\\varnothing)=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega,\\mathcal R)\n\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to F(m)\\cap F(n)=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}{}\\land\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\in\\mathcal R\n\\to\\exists a,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a(n)=\\mu(F(n)))\n\\land\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeSeries}_S(a,s)\n\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\right)=s\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}premeasure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5Premeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4RingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal R,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\n\\land\\mu(\\varnothing)=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega,\\mathcal R)\n\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to F(m)\\cap F(n)=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{22mm}{}\\land\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\in\\mathcal R\n\\to\\exists a,s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\omega,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a(n)=\\mu(F(n)))\n\\land\\mathrm{ExtendedNonnegativeSeries}_S(a,s)\n\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\right)=s\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}premeasure}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Premeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5Premeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}premeasure}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6Premeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5Premeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A premeasure is countably additive on a ring whenever the union stays in the domain.</li>\n<li>The infinite sum is no longer an unregistered term: its value is the supremum of the finite partial sums in the extended nonnegative reals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-measure4-rin